The MPEG-2 video decoder in this directory (m2v.c, m2v.h, m2v_tables.h) is derived from PL_MPEG by Dominic
Szablewski (https://github.com/phoboslab/pl_mpeg, pl_mpeg.h at commit c871f2be022ece7ef4f64230b4fb8e1fb9eb6023,
SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT): its bit reader, its VLC trees (macroblock address increment, macroblock types, coded
block pattern, motion codes, DC sizes, DCT coefficients table B-14), its macroblock prediction and its integer IDCT.
PL_MPEG decodes MPEG-1 only; the MPEG-2 parts (sequence / picture coding / quant matrix extensions, per-component
f_codes, the non-linear quantiser scale, MPEG-2 inverse quantisation with saturation and mismatch control, table B-15
for intra blocks, the MPEG-2 escape code, the DC precision) were added for the Tekken Tag Tournament PC port. The
table B-15 codes are those of ISO/IEC 13818-2 annex B. Both parts are under the MIT license below.

